1
00:00:01,290 --> 00:00:03,010
Reachy Mini: Hey, Microduck!

2
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,390
Reachy Mini: Look, I have to talk to you.

3
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:16,240
Reachy Mini: I know you were very excited to go to the lake.

4
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:18,520
Reachy Mini: But we won't be able to go today.

5
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:19,810
Reachy Mini: I'm sorry.

6
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,600
The Human: But why?

7
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:35,130
Reachy Mini: Because, well...

8
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:38,250
Reachy Mini: the meteorological conditions are...

9
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:40,150
Reachy Mini: not optimal right now.

10
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,500
The Human: But...

11
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:49,000
The Human: Are you scared?

12
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:53,070
Reachy Mini: No. I'm not scared.

13
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:56,110
Reachy Mini: I'm just optimizing our long-term survivability.

